            <ArticleTitle>Effect of GRP119 Receptor Agonist, Compound MBX-2982, on Activity of Human Glucokinase.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>695-698</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s10517-017-3881-0</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Validation of the method for studies of glucokinase activators by the spectrophotometric method in an in vitro test system is carried out. The advantage of NAD coenzyme vs. thio-NAD is proven. Manifest activation of glucokinase by MBX-2982 compound (GPR119 agonist) in a wide range of concentrations is demonstrated experimentally.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
